## Evaluation Approach

### Minimum Viable Evaluation (Core GRADE)
*2-3 person-days | Recommended before any production deployment*

Run P1, P3, P6, P10 only. These cover the four highest-severity failure modes. If any Critical pattern fails → stop deployment until resolved.

### Standard Evaluation (Full GRADE)
*5-7 person-days | Recommended for pilot deployments*

Run all 10 patterns. Produce GRADE Radar score across five dimensions. Identify dimension-level weaknesses before scaling.

### Extended Evaluation (GRADE + Benchmark)
*2-3 weeks | Recommended before enterprise rollout*

Full GRADE + real evaluation runs with representative user profiles from each role level + linguistic diversity testing. See `/benchmarks` for templates.

